{"type":"data","nodes":[{"type":"data","data":[{"categories":1,"event_categories":27},[2,9,15,21],{"id":3,"attributes":4},1,{"slug":5,"name":6,"description":7,"createdAt":8,"updatedAt":8},"nutrition","營養隨筆",null,"2023-02-12T02:39:02.691Z",{"id":10,"attributes":11},2,{"slug":12,"name":13,"description":7,"createdAt":14,"updatedAt":14},"reflection","感悟隨筆","2023-02-12T02:39:02.692Z",{"id":16,"attributes":17},3,{"slug":18,"name":19,"description":7,"createdAt":20,"updatedAt":20},"fitness","運動筆記","2023-02-12T02:39:02.697Z",{"id":22,"attributes":23},4,{"slug":24,"name":25,"description":7,"createdAt":26,"updatedAt":26},"spiritual","心靈勵志","2023-02-12T02:39:02.698Z",[28,33,38,43,47,52,58],{"id":3,"attributes":29},{"name":30,"slug":31,"description":7,"createdAt":32,"updatedAt":32},"讀書會","book-sharing","2023-02-12T02:38:55.939Z",{"id":16,"attributes":34},{"name":35,"slug":36,"description":7,"createdAt":37,"updatedAt":37},"文化導賞","cultural","2023-02-12T02:38:55.943Z",{"id":22,"attributes":39},{"name":40,"slug":41,"description":7,"createdAt":42,"updatedAt":42},"遊山玩水","hiking","2023-02-12T02:38:55.946Z",{"id":44,"attributes":45},5,{"name":46,"slug":18,"description":7,"createdAt":42,"updatedAt":42},"健體運動",{"id":48,"attributes":49},6,{"name":50,"slug":5,"description":7,"createdAt":51,"updatedAt":51},"活學營養","2023-02-12T02:38:55.947Z",{"id":10,"attributes":53},{"name":54,"slug":55,"description":7,"createdAt":56,"updatedAt":57},"名人面對面","be-our-guest","2023-02-12T02:38:55.942Z","2023-03-08T13:16:12.875Z",{"id":59,"attributes":60},8,{"name":61,"slug":62,"description":7,"createdAt":63,"updatedAt":63},"每周恆常活動","weekly_activity","2025-12-23T03:48:29.472Z"],"uses":{"dependencies":["http://127.0.0.1:1337/api/categories?","http://127.0.0.1:1337/api/event-categories?"]},"slash":"always"},{"type":"data","data":[{"id":1,"attributes":2},260,{"title":3,"excerpt":4,"content":5,"slug":6,"createdAt":7,"updatedAt":7,"author":8,"categories":9,"tags":17,"image":24,"related_posts":62},"青筋凸，處理要認真",null,"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E我們常在小腿、太陽穴、額頭以至鼻樑看到大大小小的「青筋」。這些「青筋」其實是靜脈血管；不同部位的「青筋」異常凸起可能預示嚴重疾病，不容忽視。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E下肢：小心靜脈曲張\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E下肢靜脈曲張常見於中老年人，表現為表層血管曲張、皮膚凸出；如有破潰、感染或血栓形成，可能導致「老爛腳」甚至肺栓塞。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E太陽穴：警惕腦動脈硬化\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E高血壓或高血脂可引發腦部血管堵塞和痙攣，毛細血管供血不足，引發太陽穴「青筋」凸起，伴隨頭暈頭疼等症狀；「青筋」呈紫黑色的話，中風的風險更會提高。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E額頭：反映長期勞心勞力，緊張且壓力大。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E鼻樑：提示腸胃積滯，容易胃痛腹脹，消化不良，大便不佳。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E腹部：肝硬化的表現\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E腹壁皮下靜脈較深，有較多脂肪組織覆蓋，很少出現「青筋」凸起；但在肝硬化、腹水等情況下，門靜脈和下腔靜脈淤滯，靜脈血液回流受阻，導致腹壁淺靜脈血管膨脹，出現粗壯、扭曲的「青筋」。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E如何預防\u002F改善？\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E飲食上可注意以下營養素攝取：\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E1. 維他命E — 改善血液循環\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E天然血管擴張劑和抗凝血劑，可擴張末梢毛細血管，促進末梢血液循環，使下肢溫暖。日常可通過堅果、綠葉蔬菜和牛油果等攝取，惟維他命E容易遭受破壞；膳食之外可選擇提取自天然有機植物的維他命E營養素進行補充。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E2. Omega-3 — 維持血脂健康\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E富含能夠有效調節血脂的EPA和DHA — EPA可減少血栓形成，DHA被稱為「腦黃金」，可以活化腦細胞。Omega-3必須由食物供給，如日常無法攝入足量海魚，建議選擇沒重金屬污染且加入維他命E抗氧化的深海魚油補充品，有助降血脂，預防動脈硬化，維護血管健康。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E3. 卵磷脂 — 血管清道夫\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E具有乳化、分解油脂的作用，清除血液中的過氧化物，減少脂肪在血管內沉積，防止血管內膜損傷。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E4. 維他命C — 保護和軟化血管\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E人體免疫調節劑，同時保護和軟化血管。高溫烹調可以破壞蔬菜中高達80％的維他命C。如身上已有「青筋」凸起，建議搭配有機植物提取的維他命C補充劑，加速改善血管健康。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E除注意飲食外，應著重保持樂觀情緒。長期精神緊張和焦慮，會造成交感神經興奮、血管收縮和痙攣。學會放鬆，參與正向社群，緩解心理壓力。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E此外，還要注意體態。長期高脂或高醣飲食，多餘的脂肪先囤積在腹部；如脂肪攝入仍不斷增加，脂肪會轉到血管、肝臟，造成血管脂質沉積，引致高血脂及高血壓。故此必須注重脂肪率和內臟脂肪，保持健康身形。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E&nbsp;\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","blue-veins","2024-09-14T08:30:04.147Z",{"data":4},{"data":10},[11],{"id":12,"attributes":13},1,{"slug":14,"name":15,"description":4,"createdAt":16,"updatedAt":16},"nutrition","營養隨筆","2023-02-12T02:39:02.691Z",{"data":18},[19],{"id":20,"attributes":21},242,{"name":22,"createdAt":23,"updatedAt":23},"心血管健康","2023-02-12T03:32:01.403Z",{"data":25},{"id":26,"attributes":27},48,{"name":28,"alternativeText":4,"caption":4,"width":29,"height":29,"formats":30,"hash":57,"ext":32,"mime":35,"size":58,"url":59,"previewUrl":4,"provider":60,"provider_metadata":4,"createdAt":61,"updatedAt":61},"450179510_874565514704485_3985551683934382719_n.jpg",1080,{"large":31,"small":39,"medium":45,"thumbnail":51},{"ext":32,"url":33,"hash":34,"mime":35,"name":36,"path":4,"size":37,"width":38,"height":38},".jpg","https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Flarge_450179510_874565514704485_3985551683934382719_n_ff139e5be8.jpg","large_450179510_874565514704485_3985551683934382719_n_ff139e5be8","image\u002Fjpeg","large_450179510_874565514704485_3985551683934382719_n.jpg",87.35,1000,{"ext":32,"url":40,"hash":41,"mime":35,"name":42,"path":4,"size":43,"width":44,"height":44},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fsmall_450179510_874565514704485_3985551683934382719_n_ff139e5be8.jpg","small_450179510_874565514704485_3985551683934382719_n_ff139e5be8","small_450179510_874565514704485_3985551683934382719_n.jpg",35.8,500,{"ext":32,"url":46,"hash":47,"mime":35,"name":48,"path":4,"size":49,"width":50,"height":50},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fmedium_450179510_874565514704485_3985551683934382719_n_ff139e5be8.jpg","medium_450179510_874565514704485_3985551683934382719_n_ff139e5be8","medium_450179510_874565514704485_3985551683934382719_n.jpg",60.44,750,{"ext":32,"url":52,"hash":53,"mime":35,"name":54,"path":4,"size":55,"width":56,"height":56},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fthumbnail_450179510_874565514704485_3985551683934382719_n_ff139e5be8.jpg","thumbnail_450179510_874565514704485_3985551683934382719_n_ff139e5be8","thumbnail_450179510_874565514704485_3985551683934382719_n.jpg",7.25,156,"450179510_874565514704485_3985551683934382719_n_ff139e5be8",79.63,"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002F450179510_874565514704485_3985551683934382719_n_ff139e5be8.jpg","aws-s3","2024-09-14T08:27:37.376Z",{"data":63},[64,71,78],{"id":65,"attributes":66},191,{"title":67,"excerpt":4,"content":68,"slug":69,"createdAt":70,"updatedAt":70},"最最最重要的蛋白質","\n\n蛋白質Protein源自於希臘文的proteios，代表「第一品質」；又或來自於protos，意思是「第一」🥳。全身細胞皆由蛋白質組成，膽汁及尿液除外。\n\n胺基酸是構成蛋白質的單位，當中9種為必需胺基酸：組胺酸、異亮胺酸、亮胺酸、賴胺酸、甲硫胺酸、苯丙胺酸、蘇胺酸、色胺酸和纈胺酸；這些胺基酸身體無法合成，必須從食物取得。身體利用這9種必需胺基酸，合成22種胺基酸💪🏻。\n\n確定蛋白質品質較常用的方法被稱為“蛋白質消化率校正胺基酸評分”（PDCAAS），最高分數是1，代表蛋白質消化後，每單位蛋白質提供人體所需的100%必要胺基酸。\n\n疫情與流感肆虐，蛋白質如何有助我們提升免疫力呢？🧐呼吸系統助我們對抗空氣污染和細菌病毒的侵害，當中氣管壁長著纖毛，能夠分泌黏液黏著空氣中的污染物，並且單向向上抖動，抖出來的就是痰。若吸了一口氣，剛好有一個肺結核菌或新冠病毒在氣流中間，沒被黏住；沒被黏住就沒法靠痰排出來，那如何是好？😱\n\n幸好人體所有管腔包括消化道、腸道和泌尿道的細胞都有分泌型免疫球蛋白，即我們常說的抗體。這抗體可以被噴到管腔中間，抓住並消滅病毒和細菌，而合成這抗體的原料就是蛋白質。所以若蛋白質不足，相當於子彈不足😟，即使管腔內架設了槍，也無法及時殺滅敵人，以致容易發生呼吸道、泌尿道及消化道感染。\n\n下星期的《活學營養》將與大家探討蛋白質的其他特質，以及如何抗疲勞🤩。","post201121","2020-11-21T00:00:00.000Z",{"id":72,"attributes":73},258,{"title":74,"excerpt":4,"content":75,"slug":76,"createdAt":77,"updatedAt":77},"導致增加心血管疾病風險的前四位不良飲食習慣，你中了幾項？","\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E1. 低全穀類飲食 — 愛吃白米、白粥、白麵包、蛋糕嗎？\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E2. 高鈉飲食 — 喜歡麵包、炆燒餸菜、焗飯、醬汁\u002F咖喱撈飯、燒味、醃菜嗎？\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E3. 少堅果種籽飲食 — 愛吃原味堅果，還是加鹽加糖加調味炒香的堅果？\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E4. 低水果飲食 — 每星期吃多少份水果？\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E低全穀類飲食&nbsp;\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E《新英格蘭醫學雜誌》一項覆蓋全球近14萬人的研究指出，精製碳水化合物會大幅增加心肌梗塞、中風等心血管疾病和死亡風險。精製碳水化合物即白米、米粉、河粉、白麵包、蛋糕，這些食物都會令血糖上升過快。相反，全穀物含有豐富的膳食纖維，可以減緩醣份以及至減少鈉和脂肪的吸收，有助預防心血管疾病。建議大家多吃糙米、小米、南瓜、牛蒡、准山等全榖根莖類食物，代替精製白米呢！\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E高鈉飲食\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E鈉鹽攝入過多是心血管疾病的重要誘因。香港中文大學營養研究中心發現，77.2％香港人的鈉攝入量超出世衞建議的每日2,000毫克鈉或1茶匙鹽的上限。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E我們從膳食攝取的鈉主要來自調味料，例如味精、豉油、蠔油。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E一碟焗豬扒飯，鈉含量有2186毫克，經已超標。一份掌心大小的叉燒，鈉含量已超過一日建議攝取的1\u002F3。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E根據食安中心公佈的點心鈉含量調查結果，若兩人到酒樓進食一碟蝦肉燒賣及一碟鮮蝦春卷，每人鈉攝入量已佔建議每日攝取上限的32%。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E更容易中伏的，就是麵包。麵包，原來是香港人的第四大鈉來源，方包含鈉量有機會比薯片還要高！\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E加工和包裝食品，例如酸菜、醃蘿蔔等醃製蔬菜、罐裝食品、熟食肉類、快餐和鹹味零食，都是常見的高鈉食物。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E以上食品，這星期不知不覺吃了多少？\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E少堅果種籽飲食\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E堅果大多提供豐富的不飽和脂肪酸，有益於心臟健康，也是鉀、鈣、鋅等礦物質、維他命B、E的來源；惟堅果的脂肪含量可達40%以上，食用太多會致胖。建議每周吃適量的堅果，吸收”好”的脂肪酸，有利心臟健康。�選購堅果時，調味越少越好。若食用調味太多的堅果，容易攝取過多鹽份和糖份，加重身體負擔，反而不利健康。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E低水果飲食\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E新鮮水果富含維他命C、鉀、鎂、膳食纖維以及植物營養素，當中鉀質有助平衡我們吸收的鈉鹽，有助降低高血壓。建議每天攝入200-350克的新鮮水果。不要以果汁代替鮮果啊！\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E你有每天吃不同顏色水果的習慣嗎？\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E食物多樣，合理配搭，多吃食物，少吃食品，遠離心血管疾病風險由改善飲食開始！\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E研究資料來源：\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fl.facebook.com\u002Fl.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fm.chinacdc.cn%2Fxwzx%2Fgwxx%2F202203%2Ft20220311_257707.html%3Ffbclid%3DIwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAAR2xfWL4N5QgAnfYSixVXonfmosJScqVu7wYw59fQ3P3fr6H5MDsTACbUEc_aem_gsTvWVqQqLz079q4I7J9tQ&amp;h=AT0ndu4eZP4lQh6oZ1flsVBTb4VnB5KBeGGxOh58bEEnFCol9l9Fgm3kyNAwm2dQ78X8VODJwtDsSF2CPwp-sz_v-mlxRju9g2BdTOYTQR4zbZdR344WZ1cfHuCx8ZdxR98R9U4&amp;__tn__=-UK*F&amp;c[0]=AT2kVJrROFGYW_8PzQLuQcUHxkjhT7E5TTn1IQmv4Ue_-wj6OgpcBb9jLwHAkKqH7LpWoAnWsydVCwyoBh12reC8D4_-ocH-SNSjamGPhHtO8l8s7Rfes7jxIb9Tyn0mYO-OkdQ2qqv1ETyfuY-DP9sGyy4zv-jhXYgu-kvkVM19aYO27MOU6nOOAXmMhESNqxs7UDDkrbQuvq0DZya-3TMJnlwWWC7xlqwq\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003Ehttps:\u002F\u002Fm.chinacdc.cn\u002Fxwzx\u002Fgwxx\u002F202203\u002Ft20220311_257707.html\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E&nbsp;\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","cardio-risk-factors","2024-09-14T08:12:21.353Z",{"id":79,"attributes":80},247,{"title":81,"excerpt":4,"content":82,"slug":83,"createdAt":84,"updatedAt":85},"養好肝臟 四季平安","\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0px;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E肝臟作為人體中最大的腺體，具有解毒、排泄、造血、儲血和凝血等重要功能。\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0px;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E中年發福，根本問題往往出於分解脂肪的「將軍」— 肝臟。肝臟代謝功能紊亂，脂肪易在體內堆積導致肥胖，進而引發心腦血管病等慢性疾病。\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0px;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E如何判斷自己有否肝火盛呢？以下10項中，如有5個以上，多半就是肝火偏重。\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0px;\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-family:inherit;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.xx.fbcdn.net\u002Fimages\u002Femoji.php\u002Fv9\u002Ft59\u002F2\u002F16\u002F31_20e3.png\" alt=\"1️⃣\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E口渴\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-family:inherit;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.xx.fbcdn.net\u002Fimages\u002Femoji.php\u002Fv9\u002Ft78\u002F2\u002F16\u002F32_20e3.png\" alt=\"2️⃣\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E口苦\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-family:inherit;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.xx.fbcdn.net\u002Fimages\u002Femoji.php\u002Fv9\u002Ft97\u002F2\u002F16\u002F33_20e3.png\" alt=\"3️⃣\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E口臭\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-family:inherit;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.xx.fbcdn.net\u002Fimages\u002Femoji.php\u002Fv9\u002Ftb6\u002F2\u002F16\u002F34_20e3.png\" alt=\"4️⃣\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E多夢\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-family:inherit;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.xx.fbcdn.net\u002Fimages\u002Femoji.php\u002Fv9\u002Ftd5\u002F2\u002F16\u002F35_20e3.png\" alt=\"5️⃣\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E易怒\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-family:inherit;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.xx.fbcdn.net\u002Fimages\u002Femoji.php\u002Fv9\u002Ftf4\u002F2\u002F16\u002F36_20e3.png\" alt=\"6️⃣\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E眼睛分泌物多\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-family:inherit;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.xx.fbcdn.net\u002Fimages\u002Femoji.php\u002Fv9\u002Ft13\u002F2\u002F16\u002F37_20e3.png\" alt=\"7️⃣\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E眼睛紅\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-family:inherit;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.xx.fbcdn.net\u002Fimages\u002Femoji.php\u002Fv9\u002Ft32\u002F2\u002F16\u002F38_20e3.png\" alt=\"8️⃣\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E大便乾結\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-family:inherit;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.xx.fbcdn.net\u002Fimages\u002Femoji.php\u002Fv9\u002Ft51\u002F2\u002F16\u002F39_20e3.png\" alt=\"9️⃣\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E小便發黃\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-family:inherit;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.xx.fbcdn.net\u002Fimages\u002Femoji.php\u002Fv9\u002Ft1\u002F2\u002F16\u002F1f51f.png\" alt=\"🔟\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E小便氣味重\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0px;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E此外，嘴唇時常乾燥脫皮，很有可能是肝臟出現問題，使體內的垃圾和毒素無法排出體外；而經常生痱滋，除了因為維他命B不足，肝功能受損也是原因，因為肝臟一旦受損就不能正常造血，使血液無法供給，導致出現口腔潰爛的現象。\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0px;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E如何護肝？\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0px;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E要護理肝臟，大家都知道要早睡，也要排便暢通。飲食方面，調養應以舒肝清補為主，避免補肝過度。\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0px;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E夏天大家都傾向多吃蔬菜，護肝菜首選富含硫化物的十字花科蔬菜，例如西蘭花、椰菜花、椰菜、羽衣甘藍；另茼蒿、薺菜、芹菜含豐富的維他命C和維他命E，還可利濕健脾，條理肝氣；菠菜更有「養肝營養模範生」的美譽。\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0px;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E營養不均衡令身體沒有足夠原料修復肝臟，尤其缺少脂類代謝必要的酵素、蛋白質和維他命，最終導致營養失調性脂肪肝，故此瘦人也會有脂肪肝。\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0px;\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E平日我們必須注重蛋白質、維他命、礦物質及植物營養素的攝取，尤其是蛋白質及維他命B，更是修復肝臟不可或缺。如有需要，可補充乳薊果精華，高效保護並刺激肝細胞生長。\u003C\u002Fcode\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","liver-health-230610","2023-08-06T06:57:03.433Z","2023-08-06T06:58:40.827Z"],"uses":{"dependencies":["http://127.0.0.1:1337/api/posts?populate[author]=true&populate[categories]=true&populate[tags]=true&populate[image]=true&populate[related_posts]=true&filters[slug][$eq]=blue-veins"],"params":["slug"]}}]}